      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★Request\nHaru Urara runs into frame",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "■Stage Direction\nAge: 9th grade (Junior High 3rd year)\r\nPersonality: Cheerful, good kid",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Whew... whew... goooaaal~...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Ehehe, that's a promise!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Alright, I'll follow Urara-chan's lead and give my training everything I've got!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Whether at a sports meet or during her \"dojo-busting\" matches,\nHaru Urara keeps running forward positively, even when she loses.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "She really does! Whenever I lose a race,\nI tend to get all down on myself, but...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Hah... hah... Goal!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "This isn't a mock race, it's a \"dojo-busting\" challenge!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Well then, time to keep on \"dojo-busting\"!\nMy next opponent is~...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Sure, let's run together again!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Alright, who should I \"dojo-bust\" next~?\r\nI challenge you! Come at me!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Yup! I came up with a brand-new training method~!\nSpe-chan, I challenge youuu!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Urara-chan really is amazing.\r\nNo matter what happens, she's always so bright and full of energy.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Thanks for racing with me too!\nI won't lose next time!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "You didn't just almost collapse, you straight up fell over...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "A few days after the sports meet—\nI noticed a lively gathering in one corner of the training course.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Huh, what?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I saw it in a manga yesterday! You yell \"I challenge you!\" to pick a fight,\r\nand then take down strong opponents one after another!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I'm all good now though! I got plenty of rest!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Seeing how positive Urara-chan is\ngives me the energy to do my best too.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Alrighty, who should I run with next~!\r\n...Wait, huh? Trainer!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Peeking over, it seemed the Umamusume were competing in a race format.\nWay behind the girl who had just crossed the finish line was...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Ah... she ran off...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "A short while after Special Week crosses the finish line...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "But I definitely won't lose next time!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Good job, Urara-chan.\nThat was so much fun!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Huh? Challenge...?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I-I can't go on~...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Haa... haa... I loooost~...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Her dedicated effort seemed to be inspiring everyone around her.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Ah, ...?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "A race! A race! Let's run, Spe-chan!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Ah! It's Spe-chan!\r\nSpeeee-chaaaan!!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "But I think I can win next time!\nI just have this feeling!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Oh, Urara-chan!\nAre you training too?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Seeing you zoom along at full speed,\r\nmade me feel like I could do it too!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "The manga said \"This is the path to getting stronger,\"\r\nso I decided to try it out myself!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Aahh!? Urara-chan!?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "You're really something, Spe-chan.\r\nYou truly are the rival I picked out!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Even with such a massive gap, Haru Urara sprinted with all her might\nuntil the end, then collapsed right on the spot.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Phew... phew... Goal!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "And so, Haru Urara's \"dojo-busting\" spree\nbegan once more, but...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Phew~ I almost passed out right there!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Whew... whew... mmmnnn~ gooooaaal!",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    }
  ],
  "no_wrap": true
}